{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in a perpetual reality with memories of his past lost, Denis Lythium must fight for his life against a sinister horde of zombie soldiers.\u00a0With no convenient health or ammo drops he must use anything at his disposal including his cold bare fists to defend himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viceral Combat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal combat using various weapons including ranged, melee, and throwable items to shatter your enemies to bits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/extras/0d1a6a1237a368de8edad6634581a53f.poster.avif?t=1771714292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/extras/0d1a6a1237a368de8edad6634581a53f.webm?t=1771714292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/extras/0d1a6a1237a368de8edad6634581a53f.mp4?t=1771714292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Motion Madness:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate slow motion to catch a breath or line up your next deadly shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/extras/03215cfe7c4f4bea84446c21a8c43e90.poster.avif?t=1771714292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/extras/03215cfe7c4f4bea84446c21a8c43e90.webm?t=1771714292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/extras/03215cfe7c4f4bea84446c21a8c43e90.mp4?t=1771714292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfyingly Addictive Replayabilty:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations big and small are shuffled around using fancy algorithms keeping the gameplay feeling fresh and exciting every step of the way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016570?t=1771714292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016570?t=1771714292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/7d8be246b671bf1569fd9765a09cc31df69dc839/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771714292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016570/7d8be246b671bf1569fd9765a09cc31df69dc839/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771714292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent violence, blood, and gore. Use of Alcohol. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in a perpetual reality with memories of his past lost, Denis Lythium must fight for his life against a sinister horde of zombie soldiers.\u00a0With no convenient health or ammo drops he must use anything at his disposal including his cold bare fists to defend himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viceral Combat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal combat using various weapons including ranged, melee, and throwable items to shatter your enemies to bits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m